  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REPOA CORE SUPPORT 2025-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supports to the implementation of REPOA&#x2019;s Strategic Plan (2025&#x2013;2029), which is anchored on three core goals:

1. Strategic and Collaborative Research &#x2013; including studies on economic resilience, competitiveness, and inclusive growth.
2. Capacity Building &#x2013; strengthening skills for researchers and research users.
3. Knowledge Dissemination and Stakeholder Engagement &#x2013; ensuring research outputs inform policy and practice.

Each goal prioritizes gender equality, technology and innovation, demographic transition, and youth engagement. Additionally, the research emphasizes green transition and climate change to generate evidence for improved agricultural practices, sustainable water resource management, and biodiversity conservation. These efforts aim to build resilience to climate risks and promote efficient use of energy and renewable energy solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
